<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=domestication">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Farming and food</p><h1 class="enc-title">Domestication</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Domestication is a long-term relationship in which one species takes over the control and care of another to obtain resources such as meat, milk or labour; domestication by humans began with the dog at least 15,000 years ago. Plant domestication began with wheat and barley in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/middle-east">Middle East</a> around 13,000–11,000 years ago, and goats, pigs, sheep and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cattle">cattle</a> were domesticated in the Fertile Crescent 11,000–10,000 years ago. Agriculture developed in some 13 centres, each domesticating different crops and animals. Domesticated mammals tend to be smaller and less aggressive than their wild ancestors.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/domestication.jpg" alt="Domestication" width="320" height="240" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nedih Limani · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Murgjo_Sharr_Mountain_Dog_Nedi_Limani.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>by 13,000 BCE</dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Also arose independently</span>the Fertile Crescent (goats, pigs, sheep, cattle) (11,000–10,000 years ago); East Asia (pigs) (8,000 years ago)</p><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Led to</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/plough">Plough<span>c. 2800 BCE</span></a><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/domestication-of-the-horse">Domestication of the horse<span>c. 2200 BCE</span></a><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/on-the-origin-of-species">Evolution by natural selection<span>1859</span></a></div><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=domestication">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
